**Routes:**

| Method | Path | Auth | Rate Limit |
|--------|------|------|-----------|
| GET | `/books` | No | — |
| POST | `/books` | Yes | — |
| GET | `/books/{id}` | No | — |
| PUT | `/books/{id}` | Yes | — |
| DELETE | `/books/{id}` | Yes | — |
| GET | `/books/search-external` | No | 30/min |
| POST | `/books/import-external` | Yes | — |
| GET | `/authors` | No | — |
| POST | `/authors` | Yes | — |
